  "details": "I would like to be able to check if a specific object is a type that inherits from a base class, and possibly have an output of the object that is a type of that class.\nAn example being that I have a program that would need perform an operation based on the type of collider attached to a game object, but both objects are stored in a variable of the base type, \"Collider\". Both tasks are the same, but there are 1 or 2 extra steps for say, a box collider. In this case, you could perform the standard operation, and then create a branch node asking \"is this collider a box collider?\", and perform the appropriate action.",
